      "originalText": "ControlPlane Service:\n  RegisterWorker(req) → resp\n  Heartbeat(req) → resp\n  UpdateTaskStatus(req) → resp\n\nWorkerControl Service:\n  SubmitTask(req) → resp\n  CancelTask(req) → resp\n  PlanQuery(req) → resp",
