      "text": "Job Management:\n  POST /submit, /submit_lr, /submit_pagerank\n  POST /submit_streaming\n  GET /status, /jobs, /jobs/{id}/tasks\n  POST /jobs/{id}/cancel\n\nMonitoring:\n  GET /workers, /queue_depth, /metrics\n  GET /health, /metrics/prometheus",
